---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Features</span>
      <h2>
        Built for agents.
        <br />
        Locked down for you.
      </h2>
      <p>
        Everything an AI coding tool needs to understand your data, and nothing that lets it change
        it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="card big reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="shield" />
        </div>
        <h3>Read-only, enforced twice</h3>
        <p>
          Every query is checked before it runs, and multi-statement tricks are rejected.{" "}
          <span class="mono">INSERT</span>, <span class="mono">UPDATE</span>,
          <span class="mono">DROP</span> and friends never reach your database. Pair it with a
          read-only DB user and an agent has no path to write.
        </p>
        <div class="verdicts" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="v ok">
            <span class="mono">SELECT * FROM orders</span>
            <em>allowed</em>
          </div>
          <div class="v ok">
            <span class="mono">EXPLAIN SELECT …</span>
            <em>allowed</em>
          </div>
          <div class="v no">
            <span class="mono">UPDATE users SET …</span>
            <em>blocked</em>
          </div>
          <div class="v no">
            <span class="mono">DROP TABLE invoices</span>
            <em>blocked</em>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="laptop" />
        </div>
        <h3>100% local</h3>
        <p>
          The MCP server binds to <span class="mono">127.0.0.1</span>. No account, no cloud relay,
          no hosted copy of your schema.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="key" />
        </div>
        <h3>Encrypted credentials</h3>
        <p>
          AES-256-GCM at rest. The key lives in your OS keychain, never in the database or a config
          file.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="plug" />
        </div>
        <h3>One-click client setup</h3>
        <p>
          DB MCP writes the config for Claude Desktop, Cursor, VS Code, Windsurf and LM Studio for
          you.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="filter" />
        </div>
        <h3>Context-window friendly</h3>
        <p>
          Schema filters, row caps and <span class="mono">truncated</span> flags keep big databases
          from flooding your agent.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal">
        <div class="ico">
          <Icon name="tray" />
        </div>
        <h3>Lives in your tray</h3>
        <p>
          Close the window and the server keeps serving. Restart, view logs or quit from the menu
          bar. Optional start at login.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card wide reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="ico">
            <Icon name="sparkles" />
          </div>
          <h3>Tools that guide the agent</h3>
          <p>
            Every response carries a <span class="mono">hint</span> for the next step, and errors
            come back as structured JSON. Agents recover on their own instead of guessing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <pre class="json" aria-hidden="true">{`{
  "row_count": 100,
  "truncated": true,
  "hint": "Results capped at 100 rows. Add a WHERE clause or explicit LIMIT to narrow the results."
}`}</pre>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01));
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      400px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 0%),
      rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08),
      transparent 60%
    );
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.28);
  }
  .card:hover::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .big {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-row: span 2;
  }
  .wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .wide .json {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ico {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .mono {
    font-size: 0.88em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .big h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .big p {
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 520px;
  }
  .verdicts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .v {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .v .mono {
    color: var(--fg-2);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .v em {
    flex: none;
    font: 600 11px/1 var(--mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .v.ok em {
    color: var(--green);
    background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
  }
  .v.no em {
    color: var(--red);
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.12);
  }
  .v.no .mono {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.6);
  }
  .json {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font: 12.5px/1.6 var(--mono);
    color: #a5f3fc;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .big {
      grid-row: auto;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .big,
    .wide {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
    .wide {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
